// # openOODA public catalog
//
// Logline: The list of packages opm search and opm add can install.
//
// Setup: This repo is a vendor tree. catalog is name|version|caps|deps|sha. Packages live in the eight layer folders (core kernel OS tools DE apps cloud agents) plus the root fixtures; each package folder is manifest + payload. groups.oot holds the @group install profiles. Host: https://catalog.openooda.org Not a registry service. No accounts. No daemon. Do not import package payloads from this file.
//
// Beats:
//   1. catalog — the search index. index is a copy. index.minisig signs it.
//   2. hello — print hello.
//   3. echo — print echo.
//   3b. caps — print the 20 language capability tokens.
//   3c. oocat — canonical tools-layer package (layer dirs hold the 46
//      canonical manifests; the seven withdrawn persona dirs stay
//      unindexed at the root).
//   4. .github/workflows/ci.yml is the build, test, verify, release
//      entry point (gh-owned; no scripts/ runners).
//   5. qa/ — catalog_proof.oo, check_pkg.oo, sign_index.oo, suite.oo.
//   6. docs/ — file format, host, adding a package.
//   7. Rebuild the index with: opm bot .
// import "hello/anchor.oo";
// import "echo/anchor.oo";
// import "caps/anchor.oo";
// import "qa/anchor.oo";
// import "docs/anchor.oo";
